+/// establishes the ghost fact directly with no `view()` in between.
+///
+/// Identity is decoration-sensitive, as `core::any::TypeId` is: `T`, `&T`,
+/// `Box<T>`, `Rc<T>` and `Arc<T>` are all distinct, at every level of nesting.
